  "body": "On my main account, using Firefox 95 on MacOS Monterey\r\n\r\nEvery time I change my display name from the settings, I have a timeout after about 30 seconds.\r\n\r\nNote that the display name is actually updated correctly and all my rooms get the membership event.\r\n\r\nThe request should return a 200 faster and the remaining work (sending all the state events) should continue in background.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/vector-im/element-web/issues/20375",
